{"seq":3,"slug":"git-hooks","title":"Git Hooks 钩子机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/monorepo-and-scale/git-hooks","wordCount":707,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"git-hooks-钩子机制\">Git Hooks 钩子机制</h1><h2 id=\"什么是-git-hooks\">什么是 Git Hooks</h2><p><strong>Git Hooks（钩子）</strong> 是 Git 在特定事件发生时自动执行的脚本。它们存储在 <code>.git/hooks/</code> 目录下，可以在提交、推送等操作前后运行自定义逻辑。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"ls .git/hooks/&#10;# applypatch-msg.sample  post-update.sample     pre-push.sample&#10;# commit-msg.sample      pre-applypatch.sample  pre-rebase.sample&#10;# ...\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ls</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .git/hooks/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># applypatch-msg.sample  post-update.sample     pre-push.sample</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># commit-msg.sample      pre-applypatch.sample  pre-rebase.sample</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># ...</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Hooks 把校验逻辑挂到 Git 事件上，核心概念是&quot;在哪个时机、由谁执行、能否共享&quot;：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>客户端 Hook</td>\n<td>在本地 commit/push 等时机执行的脚本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>服务端 Hook</td>\n<td>在服务端接收 push 时执行的脚本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>pre-commit</td>\n<td>提交前检查，质量门的第一道防线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>commit-msg</td>\n<td>校验提交消息格式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>版本化 Hooks</td>\n<td>通过 Husky/Lefthook 让 hook 纳入版本控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跳过</td>\n<td>--no-verify 或环境变量临时绕过</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"hook-类型\">Hook 类型</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Hook 名称</th>\n<th>触发时机</th>\n<th>常见用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>pre-commit</td>\n<td>commit 前</td>\n<td>代码风格检查、lint</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>prepare-commit-msg</td>\n<td>编辑器打开前</td>\n<td>自动填充提交消息模板</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>commit-msg</td>\n<td>提交消息写入后</td>\n<td>验证提交消息格式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>post-commit</td>\n<td>commit 完成后</td>\n<td>通知、统计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>pre-push</td>\n<td>push 前</td>\n<td>运行测试、安全扫描</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>pre-rebase</td>\n<td>rebase 前</td>\n<td>阻止在公共分支上 rebase</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>post-merge</td>\n<td>merge 完成后</td>\n<td>安装依赖、清理缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>post-checkout</td>\n<td>checkout 完成后</td>\n<td>环境切换、依赖更新</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[git commit] --&gt; B[pre-commit]&#10;    B --&gt;|通过| C[prepare-commit-msg]&#10;    C --&gt; D[commit-msg]&#10;    D --&gt;|通过| E[提交完成]&#10;    E --&gt; F[post-commit]&#10;    B --&gt;|拒绝| G[提交取消]&#10;    D --&gt;|拒绝| G\">graph LR\n    A[git commit] --&gt; B[pre-commit]\n    B --&gt;|通过| C[prepare-commit-msg]\n    C --&gt; D[commit-msg]\n    D --&gt;|通过| E[提交完成]\n    E --&gt; F[post-commit]\n    B --&gt;|拒绝| G[提交取消]\n    D --&gt;|拒绝| G</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"手动创建-hook\">手动创建 Hook</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"cat &gt; .git/hooks/pre-commit &lt;&lt; &#39;EOF&#39;&#10;#!/bin/bash&#10;echo &quot;Running pre-commit checks...&quot;&#10;&#10;if git diff --cached --name-only | grep -q &#39;\\.sh$&#39;; then&#10;    echo &quot;Checking shell scripts...&quot;&#10;    for file in $(git diff --cached --name-only --diff-filter=ACM | grep &#39;\\.sh$&#39;); do&#10;        shellcheck &quot;$file&quot;&#10;        if [ $? -ne 0 ]; then&#10;            echo &quot;ShellCheck failed for $file&quot;&#10;            exit 1&#10;        fi&#10;    done&#10;fi&#10;&#10;echo &quot;Pre-commit checks passed!&quot;&#10;EOF&#10;&#10;chmod +x .git/hooks/pre-commit\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cat</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .git/hooks/pre-commit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'EOF'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">#!/bin/bash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">echo \"Running pre-commit checks...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">if git diff --cached --name-only | grep -q '\\.sh$'; then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    echo \"Checking shell scripts...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    for file in $(git diff --cached --name-only --diff-filter=ACM | grep '\\.sh$'); do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        shellcheck \"$file\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        if [ $? -ne 0 ]; then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            echo \"ShellCheck failed for $file\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            exit 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        fi</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    done</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">fi</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">echo \"Pre-commit checks passed!\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">EOF</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">chmod</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> +x</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .git/hooks/pre-commit</span></span></code></pre></div><p>commit-msg hook 验证 Conventional Commits：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"cat &gt; .git/hooks/commit-msg &lt;&lt; &#39;EOF&#39;&#10;#!/bin/bash&#10;commit_regex=&#39;^(feat|fix|docs|style|refactor|perf|test|chore|ci)(\\(.+\\))?!?: .{1,100}&#39;&#10;if ! grep -qE &quot;$commit_regex&quot; &quot;$1&quot;; then&#10;    echo &quot;ERROR: Commit message does not follow Conventional Commits format.&quot;&#10;    echo &quot;Expected: &lt;type&gt;(&lt;scope&gt;): &lt;description&gt;&quot;&#10;    exit 1&#10;fi&#10;EOF&#10;&#10;chmod +x .git/hooks/commit-msg\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cat</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .git/hooks/commit-msg</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'EOF'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">#!/bin/bash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">commit_regex='^(feat|fix|docs|style|refactor|perf|test|chore|ci)(\\(.+\\))?!?: .{1,100}'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">if ! grep -qE \"$commit_regex\" \"$1\"; then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    echo \"ERROR: Commit message does not follow Conventional Commits format.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    echo \"Expected: &#x3C;type>(&#x3C;scope>): &#x3C;description>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    exit 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">fi</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">EOF</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">chmod</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> +x</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .git/hooks/commit-msg</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>.git/hooks/</code> 不会被 Git 跟踪，因此手动创建的 hooks 无法在团队间共享。这正是 Husky 和 Lefthook 等工具存在的原因。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"husky\">Husky</h2><p><strong>Husky</strong> 是 JavaScript 生态中最流行的 Git Hooks 管理工具，将 hooks 脚本纳入版本控制：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"npm install --save-dev husky&#10;npx husky init&#10;&#10;# .husky/pre-commit&#10;npx lint-staged&#10;&#10;# .husky/commit-msg&#10;npx --no -- commitlint --edit &quot;$1&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --save-dev</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> husky</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> husky</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> init</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .husky/pre-commit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lint-staged</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .husky/commit-msg</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --no</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> commitlint</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --edit</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">$1</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>配合 <strong>lint-staged</strong> 只检查暂存的文件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"npm install --save-dev lint-staged\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --save-dev</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lint-staged</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# package.json&#10;# {&#10;#   &quot;lint-staged&quot;: {&#10;#     &quot;*.{js,ts}&quot;: [&quot;eslint --fix&quot;, &quot;prettier --write&quot;],&#10;#     &quot;*.sh&quot;: [&quot;shellcheck&quot;],&#10;#     &quot;*.md&quot;: [&quot;prettier --write&quot;]&#10;#   }&#10;# }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># package.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#   \"lint-staged\": {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#     \"*.{js,ts}\": [\"eslint --fix\", \"prettier --write\"],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#     \"*.sh\": [\"shellcheck\"],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#     \"*.md\": [\"prettier --write\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#   }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># }</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[git commit] --&gt; B[Husky pre-commit]&#10;    B --&gt; C[lint-staged]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;只检查暂存文件&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[ESLint]&#10;    D --&gt; F[Prettier]&#10;    D --&gt; G[ShellCheck]\">graph LR\n    A[git commit] --&gt; B[Husky pre-commit]\n    B --&gt; C[lint-staged]\n    C --&gt; D[\"只检查暂存文件\"]\n    D --&gt; E[ESLint]\n    D --&gt; F[Prettier]\n    D --&gt; G[ShellCheck]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"lefthook\">Lefthook</h2><p><strong>Lefthook</strong> 是一个快速、跨语言的 Git Hooks 管理器，使用 Go 编写，比 Husky 更快：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"brew install lefthook&#10;lefthook install\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">brew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lefthook</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">lefthook</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# lefthook.yml&#10;pre-commit:&#10;  parallel: true&#10;  commands:&#10;    lint:&#10;      glob: &quot;*.{js,ts}&quot;&#10;      run: npx eslint {staged_files}&#10;    format:&#10;      glob: &quot;*.{js,ts,json,md}&quot;&#10;      run: npx prettier --check {staged_files}&#10;    shellcheck:&#10;      glob: &quot;*.sh&quot;&#10;      run: shellcheck {staged_files}&#10;&#10;commit-msg:&#10;  commands:&#10;    validate:&#10;      run: &#39;echo &quot;$1&quot; | grep -qE &quot;^(feat|fix|docs|style|refactor|perf|test|chore|ci)&quot;&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># lefthook.yml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pre-commit:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  parallel:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  commands:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    lint:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      glob:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"*.{js,ts}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      run:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> eslint</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> {staged_files}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    format:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      glob:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"*.{js,ts,json,md}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      run:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> prettier</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --check</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> {staged_files}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    shellcheck:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      glob:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"*.sh\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      run:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> shellcheck</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> {staged_files}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">commit-msg:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  commands:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    validate:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      run:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'echo \"$1\" | grep -qE \"^(feat|fix|docs|style|refactor|perf|test|chore|ci)\"'</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>Husky</th>\n<th>Lefthook</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>语言</td>\n<td>JavaScript</td>\n<td>Go</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>速度</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配置格式</td>\n<td>文件脚本</td>\n<td>YAML</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并行执行</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨语言</td>\n<td>需要 Node.js</td>\n<td>无依赖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生态</td>\n<td>npm 生态丰富</td>\n<td>通用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"跳过-hooks\">跳过 Hooks</h2><p>紧急情况下可以临时跳过 hooks：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git commit --no-verify -m &quot;hotfix: urgent production fix&quot;&#10;git push --no-verify&#10;&#10;LEFTHOOK=0 git commit -m &quot;skip hooks&quot;&#10;HUSKY=0 git commit -m &quot;skip hooks&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> commit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --no-verify</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"hotfix: urgent production fix\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> push</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --no-verify</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">LEFTHOOK</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> commit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"skip hooks\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">HUSKY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> commit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"skip hooks\"</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>--no-verify</code> 应仅用于紧急情况。如果团队成员频繁使用此选项，说明 hooks 可能过重或有误报，需要优化。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"服务端-hooks\">服务端 Hooks</h2><p>除了客户端 hooks，Git 服务端也支持 hooks：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Hook</th>\n<th>触发时机</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>pre-receive</td>\n<td>push 到服务端前</td>\n<td>强制执行分支保护策略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>update</td>\n<td>每个分支更新前</td>\n<td>分支级别的权限控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>post-receive</td>\n<td>push 完成后</td>\n<td>触发 CI/CD、通知</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((Git Hooks))&#10;    客户端 Hook&#10;      pre-commit&#10;      commit-msg&#10;      pre-push&#10;    工具&#10;      Husky&#10;      Lefthook&#10;      lint-staged&#10;    服务端 Hook&#10;      pre-receive&#10;      post-receive&#10;    最佳实践&#10;      版本控制 hooks&#10;      并行执行&#10;      保持快速\">mindmap\n  root((Git Hooks))\n    客户端 Hook\n      pre-commit\n      commit-msg\n      pre-push\n    工具\n      Husky\n      Lefthook\n      lint-staged\n    服务端 Hook\n      pre-receive\n      post-receive\n    最佳实践\n      版本控制 hooks\n      并行执行\n      保持快速</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>Git Hooks</strong> 在特定事件时自动执行脚本，是本地代码质量保障的第一道防线</li>\n<li><strong>pre-commit</strong> 用于代码检查，<strong>commit-msg</strong> 用于消息格式验证，<strong>pre-push</strong> 用于测试</li>\n<li><strong>Husky</strong> 适合 JavaScript 生态，<strong>Lefthook</strong> 更快且跨语言，根据项目技术栈选择</li>\n<li>配合 <strong>lint-staged</strong> 只检查暂存文件，避免全量检查带来的性能问题</li>\n<li>Hooks 应保持<strong>快速执行</strong>（秒级），耗时的检查应放到 CI 而非本地 hooks 中</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Git Hooks 钩子机制","id":"git-hooks-钩子机制"},{"level":2,"text":"什么是 Git Hooks","id":"什么是-git-hooks"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Hook 类型","id":"hook-类型"},{"level":2,"text":"手动创建 Hook","id":"手动创建-hook"},{"level":2,"text":"Husky","id":"husky"},{"level":2,"text":"Lefthook","id":"lefthook"},{"level":2,"text":"跳过 Hooks","id":"跳过-hooks"},{"level":2,"text":"服务端 Hooks","id":"服务端-hooks"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"稀疏检出与部分克隆","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/monorepo-and-scale/sparse-checkout"},"next":{"title":"性能调优","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/monorepo-and-scale/performance-tuning"}}